SkyBlock accessory metadata
---------------------------
The client fetches factual item IDs, family names and tier numbers from the
public Skyblocker accessory endpoint, https://hysky.de/api/accessories,
and caches the latest successful response locally. Skyblocker source:
https://github.com/SkyblockerMod/Skyblocker
No Skyblocker Java implementation or assets are included. The tooltip and local
Accessory Bag scanner are independently implemented by CustomCosmetics.

